            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <h2>Our Mission</h2>
                <p>The QR Code-Based Examination Attendance Management System was designed to eliminate the challenges of traditional attendance tracking in educational institutions. Manual sign-in sheets are prone to fraud, time-consuming, and difficult to analyze.</p>
                <p>Our system leverages QR code technology to provide a fast, secure, and verifiable method of recording student attendance during examinations. Each student receives a unique, encrypted QR code that is validated in real-time during the exam.</p>

                <h2 class="mt-4">Key Features</h2>
                <ul class="about-features-list">
                    <li>
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span><strong>Unique QR Codes</strong> — Each student gets a uniquely encrypted QR code per examination, preventing duplication and sharing.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span><strong>Real-time Verification</strong> — Lecturers scan and verify student identity instantly with photo confirmation.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span><strong>Anti-Impersonation</strong> — The system detects and rejects duplicate scans, expired codes, and unauthorized attempts.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span><strong>Comprehensive Reports</strong> — Generate detailed attendance reports exportable to PDF and Excel formats.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span><strong>Role-Based Access</strong> — Separate dashboards for students, lecturers, and administrators with appropriate permissions.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span><strong>Mobile Responsive</strong> — Works seamlessly on desktops, tablets, and smartphones for maximum convenience.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
